    "description": "Stonemason, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 312 blocks vs 125 (first build 262 vs 90; the walled, paved yard is most of it). Flush piece (ground_layer 0: the mod does not support it yet). Walled stone yard round an open stone brick shed under a spruce gable roof: grindstone, cutting bench, rough and dressed stone, a banker; L2 adds the stonecutter and a stand of half-cut blocks along the front wall; L3 a statue in progress with its scaffold, banner, flowers. Not yet builder-tested: andesite_wall, chiseled_stone_bricks, polished_andesite, polished_andesite_stairs, smooth_stone_slab, stone_brick_slab, stone_brick_wall, stonecutter. Decoration step adds: item, sign_text.",
